*> vybe-test: cobol/occurs_depending_on/test_odo_indexed_lookup
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_occurs_depending_on.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 3.
01 WS-TABLE.
   05 WS-ENTRY PIC 9(2) OCCURS 1 TO 6 TIMES DEPENDING ON WS-COUNT INDEXED BY WS-IDX.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE 12 TO WS-ENTRY(1).
    MOVE 24 TO WS-ENTRY(2).
    MOVE 36 TO WS-ENTRY(3).
    MOVE 48 TO WS-ENTRY(4).
    SET WS-IDX TO 2.
    DISPLAY WS-ENTRY(WS-IDX).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-ENTRY(WS-IDX) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "24"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [24] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

